<title>UK: No Austrian bids for free-mkt grain at EU tender.</title>
<headline>No Austrian bids for free-mkt grain at EU tender.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian traders  submitted no bids for free market grain at Thursday's EU tender, member state officials said.</p>
<p>The EU cereals management committee will adjudicate the tender at its meeting on Thursday afternoon. --Christopher Lyddon, London newsroom +44 171 542 7928</p>
</text>
